  <String Id="ExitDialogTitle">安装完成</String>
  <String Id="ExitDialogDescription">VPOT 已成功安装</String>
  <String Id="ExitDialogBody">请打开开始菜单,运行 &quot;VPOT&quot;(install-windows.cmd)完成环境检测与容器部署。&#13;&#10;服务启动后访问 https://127.0.0.1:18800。</String>
